+"""Tests for Exp5735 zero-gated KAN residual growth.
+
+Spec refs: REQ-LEARN-5735,
+SCENARIO-LEARN-5735-ZERO-GATE,
+SCENARIO-LEARN-5735-CHRONOLOGY,
+SCENARIO-LEARN-5735-BASELINES,
+SCENARIO-LEARN-5735-RELEASE.
